{"4196970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asumi: Little Ones", "steam_appid": 4196970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend the Inhabitants of the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a spirit of the forest just awoken from a deep slumber, you find yourself on an island full of cute birds, insects and all kinds of animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this mysterious island, traversing forests, beaches and caverns. Find out more about your new home as you also make friends and grow as a little spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/8ab418757d327678135181b3749fb5e0.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Register Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty special Camera to register important moments and discover more about how the environment works. As you take pictures, you gain precious knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/d74824be6d1df9b22464c1430a421055.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the Tome</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have your tome, your diary, your adventurer's journal. Register all the animals on the island, to earn their badges and their trust, and to learn more about how to interact and help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/16bcfb680013c0b52bacda02d242395f.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ original animals, complete with animation, player interactions and a complex routine system,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ collectible items to craft structures, feed animals and get closer for the perfect photo,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration tools, such as the camera, the flute, and the lantern,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle that changes which animals appear and what they are doing.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend the Inhabitants of the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a spirit of the forest just awoken from a deep slumber, you find yourself on an island full of cute birds, insects and all kinds of animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this mysterious island, traversing forests, beaches and caverns. Find out more about your new home as you also make friends and grow as a little spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/8ab418757d327678135181b3749fb5e0.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Register Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty special Camera to register important moments and discover more about how the environment works. As you take pictures, you gain precious knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/d74824be6d1df9b22464c1430a421055.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the Tome</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have your tome, your diary, your adventurer's journal. Register all the animals on the island, to earn their badges and their trust, and to learn more about how to interact and help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/extras/16bcfb680013c0b52bacda02d242395f.avif?t=1787260827\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ original animals, complete with animation, player interactions and a complex routine system,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ collectible items to craft structures, feed animals and get closer for the perfect photo,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration tools, such as the camera, the flute, and the lantern,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle that changes which animals appear and what they are doing.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore this cozy and mysterious island full of cute animals. Take pictures, pet them, interact, climb, swim and ride, as you adventure into the unknown to find new friends and learn more about your own origin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/3b61ad2f3404fc5a52118c5a7dd9b63a22bf9b68/header.jpg?t=1787260827", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/b9a175612dce34903373cd8e5b8c7cfa6e7d01cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787260827", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196970/b9a175612dce34903373cd8e5b8c7cfa6e7d01cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787260827", "website": "https://www.madeinbugs.com.br/en/projects/asumi/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</